---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Articles About Rolfing, Pain & Posture | Ryan’s Rolfing" description="Educational articles about Rolfing Structural Integration, bodywork, pain, posture, and Somatic Experiencing in Folsom, CA.">
  <section class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
   <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#c4924a]">
     Articles
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl leading-tight md:text-7xl">
     Useful writing about bodywork, pain, posture, and change.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-[#545454]/85">
     Practical articles for people exploring Rolfing Structural Integration, Somatic Experiencing, NeuroAffective Touch, and nervous-system-informed bodywork in Folsom.
    </p>
   </div>
   <div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl">
    <a class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-[#545454] text-white shadow-lg transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl md:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr]" href="/blog/rolfing-jaw-neck-headache-connection/">
     <div class="bg-[#c4924a] p-8 md:p-10">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/80">
       Featured article
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-tight text-white">
       The Jaw, Neck &amp; Headache Connection
      </h2>
     </div>
     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
       Jaw, neck, and headaches
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xl leading-9 text-white/82">
       How Rolfing looks at jaw tension, neck pain, headaches, migraines, shoulders, ribs, breath, and posture as connected patterns.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
       Read featured article →
      </p>
     </div>
    </a>
   </div>
   <div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-5xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <a class="block rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-8 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md" href="/blog/rolfing-for-back-pain-folsom/">
     <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Back pain and bodywork
     </p>
     <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight">
      Rolfing for Back Pain in Folsom
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
      How Rolfing looks beyond the painful spot to posture, breath, fascia, movement, and whole-body support.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Read article →
     </p>
    </a>
    <a class="block rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-8 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md" href="/blog/rolfing-for-posture-folsom/">
     <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Posture and movement
     </p>
     <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight">
      Rolfing for Posture in Folsom
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
      A practical look at posture as support, adaptability, breath, and movement — not rigid correction.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Read article →
     </p>
    </a>
    <a class="block rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-8 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md" href="/blog/what-to-expect-first-rolfing-session/">
     <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
      First session guide
     </p>
     <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight">
      What to Expect in Your First Rolfing Session
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
      What happens before, during, and after a first Rolfing session with Ryan in Folsom.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Read article →
     </p>
    </a>
    <a class="block rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-8 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md" href="/blog/rolfing-ten-series-folsom/">
     <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Rolfing Ten Series
     </p>
     <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight">
      Rolfing Ten Series in Folsom
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
      What the classic Ten Series is, how it builds, and who may benefit from a structured whole-body process.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Read article →
     </p>
    </a>
    <a class="block rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-8 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md" href="/blog/rolfing-vs-massage-folsom/">
     <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Rolfing Structural Integration
     </p>
     <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight">
      Rolfing vs massage: what’s the difference?
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
      A clear guide to how Rolfing differs from massage, when each approach makes sense, and how to choose the right bodywork in Folsom.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-6 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#c4924a]">
      Read article →
     </p>
    </a>
   </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
